1
00:00:00,832 --> 00:00:02,962
(Sheldon:)I know Hawking's not busy,
because I can see...

2
00:00:03,135 --> 00:00:04,965
(Sheldon:)...he's playing other people right now.

3
00:00:05,637 --> 00:00:09,597
(Leonard:)Maybe since you're so good,
he's taking his time to meet the challenge.

4
00:00:09,808 --> 00:00:13,298
(Leonard:)- I want Penny to enjoy...
- Wolowitz told me he's a big baby.

5
00:00:13,512 --> 00:00:16,572
Yeah, I didn't know that,
and I played "extract" for 82 points.

6
00:00:16,782 --> 00:00:19,012
Oh, it's all Amy's fault.
She told me to play it.

7
00:00:19,184 --> 00:00:21,744
(Sheldon:)I have got to cut her loose.

8
00:00:22,954 --> 00:00:25,084
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I wasn't done talking.

9
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:28,620
(Leonard:)She hands in the paper tomorrow.
I know I could help her.

10
00:00:28,827 --> 00:00:31,797
(Leonard:)And she's my girlfriend.
I should be allowed to help her.

11
00:00:31,997 --> 00:00:35,027
(Leonard:)- Why aren't I allowed to help her?
- I hear you, brother.

12
00:00:36,168 --> 00:00:39,038
(Leonard:)No, you need to give me some advice.

13
00:00:39,237 --> 00:00:40,897
Uh, fine. Women, huh?

14
00:00:44,709 --> 00:00:46,639
(Leonard:)Specific to my situation.

15
00:00:46,845 --> 00:00:47,865
Blond women, huh?

16
00:00:50,682 --> 00:00:52,982
- Empathetic.
- Sucks to be you.

17
00:00:53,185 --> 00:00:54,205
I quit!

18
00:00:54,719 --> 00:01:00,019
(Sheldon:)Leonard, wait, no.
I listened to your dumb thing.

